# nocheck: persona-block-rationale — the native Nextcloud administrator signs in with the role-local secrets.credentials.administrator_password (meta/secrets.yml, NEXTCLOUD_DIRECT_LOGIN_PASSWORD above), not with the Keycloak secret, so this role renders LOGIN_USERNAME / LOGIN_PASSWORD instead of the ADMIN_USERNAME / ADMIN_PASSWORD pair the shared helper reads (roles/test-e2e-playwright/files/personas/admin.js:29-30) and the helper has nothing to type; the admin chain is driven by files/playwright/test-login-admin-native.js and test-login-admin-oidc.js (see README "Persona contract opt-outs").
PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true

# nocheck: persona-block-rationale — Nextcloud's login surface has three shapes depending on the variant (native / oidc_login / sociallogin, files/playwright/_shared.js:19-23) and the #firstrunwizard modal intercepts pointer events on the user menu the generic logout must click (files/playwright/_shared.js:160-175), so biber's chain is driven by files/playwright/test-login-biber-oidc.js and test-login-biber-ldap.js (see README "Persona contract opt-outs").
PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true

